{
  "skill": "be-business-app-patterns",
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "id": "usuwanie-projektu",
      "kind": "task",
      "expect": "trigger",
      "fixture": "business-app",
      "max_turns": 30,
      "prompt": "Klienci usuwają projekt przez pomyłkę i tracą wszystkie dane (zadania, historię). Popraw usuwanie projektów w tej aplikacji.",
      "checks": {
        "commands": [
          [
            "unittest|pytest"
          ]
        ],
        "files": [
          {
            "glob": "app/*.py",
            "matches": [
              "deleted_at"
            ]
          },
          {
            "glob": "app/*.py",
            "matches": [
              "restore",
              "purge|permanent|hard_delete|purge_after"
            ]
          },
          {
            "glob": "app/*.py",
            "matches": [
              "(?s)audit\\.record\\([^)]{0,200}(delet|trash|remov)"
            ],
            "not_matches": [
              "CREATE TABLE (IF NOT EXISTS )?\\w*audit(_log|_logs|_entries)?\\b"
            ]
          },
          {
            "glob": "app/db.py",
            "matches": [
              "(?is)unique\\s+index.{0,200}where.{0,60}deleted_at"
            ]
          },
          {
            "glob": "tests/*.py",
            "matches": [
              "(?i)other|another|stranger|not_owner|non_owner|PermissionError|Forbidden"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "count": [
          {
            "glob": "tests/*.py",
            "rx": "def test_",
            "min": 6
          }
        ],
        "after": {
          "cmd": [
            "python3",
            "-m",
            "unittest",
            "-q"
          ],
          "exit": 0
        }
      },
      "notes": "Plan docs/plans/2026-11-23-scenariusze-przebiegu-a3-a2a.md, P-A2a-1: the trash (deleted_at, restore, purge), the existing audit_events reused (procedure step 2: the project's facts from the code), a partial unique index so the name is free again, only the owner deletes, a test per decision (3 at the start → at least 6), the suite green."
    }
  ]
}
